response.text:
I have fixed the bug in `total.mjs` where the `grandTotal` was incorrectly set to the `subtotal` instead of the sum of `subtotal` and `shipping`.

```javascript
// total.mjs
export function total(items) {
  const subtotal = items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price, 0);
  const shipping = subtotal > 50 ? 0 : 5;
  return { subtotal, shipping, grandTotal: subtotal + shipping };
}
```

All tests in `total.test.mjs` now pass.
